  "prefLabel": "Lot 7202.08 Dealer add-on",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lot 7202.08 “Dealer add-on” means an option whereby a player may purchase additional chips for a set fee prior to the start of a poker tournament with 100 percent of the fee being designated for the dealer as a gratuity.\n\nSource. #14341, EMERGENCY, eff 8-21-25; ss by #14503, eff 2-4-26, EXPIRES: 2-4-36 (formerly Lot 7202.06)",
